{
  "dom_id": "step-132154",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Evaluating Expressions With Exponents Inside Parentheses",
  "problem": "What is the value of $\\left( 5 \\div (-2)^2 \\right) \\times \\left( -\\dfrac{4}{5} \\right).$",
  "worked_solution": "To evaluate this expression, we use PEMDAS. First, consider the expression inside the parenthesis:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5÷(-2)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying PEMDAS to this expression, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5÷(-2)^{2} & = \\\\ 5÷4 & = \\\\ \\frac{5}{4} & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we multiply:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\overset{\\frac{5}{4}}{\\overset{⏞}{5÷(-2)^{2}}})\\times (-\\frac{4}{5}) & = \\\\ \\frac{5}{4}\\times (-\\frac{4}{5}) & = \\\\ -\\frac{5}{4}\\times \\frac{4}{5} & = \\\\ -\\frac{5\\times 4}{4\\times 5} & = \\\\ -\\frac{\\cancel{5}\\times \\cancel{4}}{\\cancel{4}\\times \\cancel{5}} & = \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-132154\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"132154\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"12923\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-132154\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-10\">Evaluating Expressions With Exponents Inside Parentheses</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"132154\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n     